{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/21/2637212/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"°HELLO"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/21/2637212/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月23日！わたしは18歳になりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/21/2637212/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バナナマンの設楽さんもまあやと同じ誕生日と星座と血液型も同じ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/21/2637212/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだかとても嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/21/2637212/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年設楽さんの誕生日近くに収録した時\nまあやもおなじだよな？って言ってくださったのがとっても嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/21/2637212/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/21/2637212/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂に入った当初は中学に入学したばっかりで13歳だったのにー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長いようであっという間だったなぁ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/21/2637212/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日の握手会では沢山の方にお祝いしてもらって\n本当に感謝の気持ちでいっぱいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/21/2637212/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/21/2637212/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/21/2637212/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/21/2637212/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/21/2637212/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここには載せきれないぐらいです‥\nこの写真では真ん中にいた皆様しか写ってないけど、会場の端から端まで沢山いて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんながハッピーバースデーを歌ってくれて‥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/21/2637212/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/21/2637212/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうして祝ってくだって、\nいつもいつもパワーをくれて心強い素敵な皆様がいて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言葉にしなくてもなんとなぁく！\nわかってくれる！支えてくれる家族がいて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/21/2637212/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仕事で学校行かないと\n次はいつ来るの？とか授業のノートを見せてくれる友達がいて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"辛い時や考え事をしてる時、全部聞いてくれる最高の友達がいて、\n本当に悩んでること、辛いことはなかなか人に言えないまあやだけど高校入って\nなんでも言える素敵な友達にも出会えて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもまあやまあや！って言って裏で支えてくれる大好きな明るいスタッフさんもいて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周りの人に感謝することばっかりで‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやはまだまだこどもだなぁ〜って思うこともある！\nだから18歳はもっともっと素敵な女性になれるようにがんばる！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/21/2637212/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ノギビンゴのプンプン選手権！みてくれましたかぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優勝しました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/21/2637212/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれはグアムの時のエピソードで、やっぱ現地のグアムのオレンジは固いのかなぁ？\nと思ったり‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもあの硬さは困っちゃいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/21/2637212/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてラーメンウォーカーもみてねっ♪今回もとっても美味しくて撮影も楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/21/2637212/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木えいごや 乃木ごるふ、そして雑誌などなど沢山の感想コメントもありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/21/2637212/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にいつもありがとうございます！！！これからも上に向かって頑張ります！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"九州地方で地震がありましたね。\n今もまだ余震が続いて\n他人事ではありません！\n1人の力は小さいかもしれないけど、できることからしていきます。1日でも早い復興を願っています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"18歳になれたことに感謝しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校三年生18歳\n和田まあや"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/21/2637212/0002.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}